--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled stroke data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Hanzi stroke outlines, stroke order, and medians are packaged from the
hanzi-writer-data project. The underlying glyph data derives from Make Me a
Hanzi, which is in turn derived from the Arphic PL fonts.

