The exact upstream commit the bundled shards were generated from is recorded
in tools/DATA_PROVENANCE.md.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Design and implementation references
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The clipped stroke-reveal animation and guided-quiz conventions follow those
established by Hanzi Writer (above). The Flutter package stroke_order_animator
was an additional conceptual reference for the animation controller API; no
code was copied from it.

  stroke_order_animator      BSD-3-Clause License
  https://pub.dev/packages/stroke_order_animator

